PARITY COVERAGE (vs web ChargeSessionChartWidget.tsx)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data sources (bound via shared P1/S8 state holders; no HTTP in the view):
  useVehicles -> active-vehicle StateFlow<Long?> resolution (web `vehicleId ?? vehicles?.[0]?.id`)
  useQuery('/charging?vehicle_id=&limit=10') -> ChargingStore.sessionsPaginated(vehicleId, limit=10)
  useDateFormat (formatDateShort) -> DateTimeFormatter "MMM d" at the projection boundary
  useTranslation -> Android string resources (P1/S10 catalog)
States (all rendered, none hidden): loading (stat-grid + chart skeleton), empty (no vehicle/no rows
  -> "No charge sessions yet"), error (QueryError + Retry), content (stats + bar chart + legend),
  stale + offline (content kept + freshness chip). Compact (1x1) shows the stat row only (web compact).
Chart: web Recharts BarChart color-coded per `<Cell>` -> Compose Vico BarChartWrapper with one series
  per charger kind (Home=success/green, Supercharger=danger/red, DC=warning/amber); per-session energy
  in kWh (convertEnergyFromSI(wh,'kWh') = wh/1000), reversed oldest-first; legend = home/supercharger/dc.
Stats: Total / Avg (kWh, 1 decimal) + Sessions count (web `stats` useMemo).
i18n keys (resolve from the P1/S10 catalog):
  widget.chargeSessionChart.title/total/avg/sessions/empty -> R.string.translation_widget_chargeSessionChart_*
  legend labels reuse chargerTypes.home/supercharger/dc -> R.string.translation_chargerTypes_* ("Home / AC",
  "Supercharger", "DC Fast") — identical copy to the web CHARGER_TYPE_LABEL. Generic: translation_common_refresh,
  translation_a11y_loading.
Registry: id="charge-session-chart", category="charging", default 2x4, min 1x2, max 4x40 (matches web).
